sequenceDiagram
    actor Student as Student
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as Diploma API
    participant Queue as Build Queue
    participant Compiler as Compiler Worker
    database DB as Metadata DB
    participant Storage as Object Storage
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Student->>UI: Upload diagram source and select profile
    UI->>API: POST /diagrams with source file
    API->>DB: Create diagram record
    API->>Queue: Enqueue render job
    Queue-->>API: job_id
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted with job status URL
    loop Poll until completed
        UI->>API: GET /jobs/{job_id}
        API->>DB: Read render status
        API-->>UI: status and validation summary
    end
    Queue->>Compiler: Start isolated render job
    Compiler->>Compiler: Parse source and detect profile
    alt Source is valid
        Compiler->>Compiler: Layout elements and route connectors
        Compiler->>Storage: Save .drawio and PNG artifacts
        Compiler->>DB: Mark job as completed
        Notify-->>Student: Send result link
    else Source has unsupported notation
        Compiler->>Storage: Save diagnostics bundle
        Compiler->>DB: Mark job as failed
        Notify-->>Student: Send readable error summary
    end
    Student->>UI: Open PNG preview
    UI->>Storage: Download PNG artifact
    Storage-->>UI: Rendered diagram PNG
